# Host paths mounted into a local container run, one per line, as
# host:container[:ro]; $HOME is expanded. The Atelic checkout stands in for
# the deploy key clone the HubSpot pull makes in production, so a rehearsal
# here runs the funnel rules of the checkout on this machine and needs no
# secret this machine lacks.
$HOME/Eudaimonia/Craft/Vocation/Atelic:/home/runner/Eudaimonia/Craft/Vocation/Atelic:ro
# The homebase checkout on this machine, mounted read only, so a local run
# reads the planning rules from here instead of cloning the public repo.
$HOME/Eudaimonia/Craft/Development/personal/homebase:/home/runner/Eudaimonia/Craft/Development/personal/homebase:ro
